description=Native Link to Windows (phone screen, Apps, black screen, PC keyboard) on rooted stock Android 17, the way an OEM ships it. Includes the LtwEmu LSPosed/Vector module; needs Zygisk + Vector/LSPosed, and on KernelSU a metamodule. Action button = health check.
